WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:14.549
A guard walked through Metro City Prison.

2
00:00:14.569 --> 00:00:16.990
"Lights out," she called.

3
00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.651
"It's bedtime!"

4
00:00:23.053 --> 00:00:23.873
In his cell Mr.

5
00:00:23.913 --> 00:00:25.734
Presto grumbled and climbed into bed.

6
00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:28.935
Mrs. Wiggles and Dr.

7
00:00:29.055 --> 00:00:30.436
Odd were in nearby cells.

8
00:00:33.572 --> 00:00:35.153
"I hate bedtime!"

9
00:00:35.473 --> 00:00:36.353
Mrs. Wiggles said.

10
00:00:37.074 --> 00:00:38.174
The guard ignored the villain.

11
00:00:40.295 --> 00:00:41.396
She walked around a corner.

12
00:00:44.037 --> 00:00:44.977
Then she gasped.

13
00:00:45.737 --> 00:00:47.078
There was a huge hole in the wall.

14
00:00:48.138 --> 00:00:48.999
The guard shouted.

15
00:00:49.019 --> 00:00:52.360
"A prisoner escaped!"

16
00:00:55.982 --> 00:00:56.822
"Where's Terrell?"

17
00:00:57.122 --> 00:00:57.763
Jack asked.

18
00:00:58.743 --> 00:01:00.864
Roxy and Mara were waiting outside Jack's house.

19
00:01:01.804 --> 00:01:04.285
"He's going to be a little late today," Roxy said.

20
00:01:04.305 --> 00:01:06.206
"We can walk to school without him."

21
00:01:10.328 --> 00:01:12.228
The three friends walked along the sidewalk.

22
00:01:12.248 --> 00:01:14.830
"Why is Terrell going to be late?"

23
00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:15.730
Jack asked.

24
00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:17.171
Mara chuckled.

25
00:01:17.191 --> 00:01:22.373
"He's probably at home, trying to figure out who Rocket Girl really is!"

26
00:01:23.233 --> 00:01:23.913
Jack laughed.

27
00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:26.635
Roxy grinned.

28
00:01:27.355 --> 00:01:29.136
"No, he's at a dentist appointment."

29
00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:32.081
Soon they arrived at school.

30
00:01:33.562 --> 00:01:35.964
As they reached their classroom, Roxy heard her watch beep.

31
00:01:35.984 --> 00:01:38.967
"I'll be right in," Roxy said.

32
00:01:38.987 --> 00:01:42.069
"I have to, um, use the restroom."

33
00:01:44.892 --> 00:01:46.133
Roxy ducked around a corner.

34
00:01:46.153 --> 00:01:48.975
"Mayor Bloom," she whispered.

35
00:01:48.995 --> 00:01:50.696
"Is everything okay?"

36
00:01:51.697 --> 00:01:53.018
The mayor looked confused.

37
00:01:53.038 --> 00:01:55.160
"I'm not sure, Rocket Girl.

38
00:01:55.961 --> 00:01:58.222
I think someone escaped from Metro City Prison."

39
00:01:58.242 --> 00:02:00.893
"Who?" Roxy asked.

40
00:02:00.913 --> 00:02:03.495
"I don't know," Mayor Bloom said.

41
00:02:03.515 --> 00:02:06.397
"The guards spent the night checking cells.

42
00:02:07.178 --> 00:02:08.859
All the prisoners are still there."

43
00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.161
Roxy scratched her head.

44
00:02:11.181 --> 00:02:13.143
"I don't understand, Mayor.

45
00:02:13.784 --> 00:02:15.165
Why do you think someone escaped?"

46
00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:18.908
"There's a big hole in the prison wall," Mayor Bloom said.

47
00:02:18.928 --> 00:02:20.970
"It's very suspicious."

48
00:02:22.031 --> 00:02:23.732
"Okay, Mayor," Roxy said.

49
00:02:23.752 --> 00:02:25.413
"I'm on my way."

50
00:02:26.474 --> 00:02:28.156
Suddenly the school doors flew open.

51
00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.922
Shwoom! A loud humming sound filled the air.

52
00:02:35.422 --> 00:02:36.543
Roxy closed her watch.

53
00:02:37.504 --> 00:02:39.925
She felt an invisible force pulling on her.

54
00:02:40.425 --> 00:02:43.287
Teachers and students flew by, as if a vacuum was pulling them.

55
00:02:45.508 --> 00:02:48.630
Using her super strength, Roxy kept her feet planted on the floor.

56
00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.191
Mara and Jack flew by.

57
00:02:51.211 --> 00:02:54.413
"Ahh!" Mara screamed.

58
00:02:55.613 --> 00:02:57.034
"Help!" Jack shouted.

59
00:02:57.634 --> 00:02:59.996
Books, pencils, and papers dropped from backpacks.

60
00:03:01.216 --> 00:03:02.357
The hallway was a mess.

61
00:03:03.338 --> 00:03:04.739
A moment later everyone was gone.

62
00:03:08.762 --> 00:03:09.403
Roxy thought.

63
00:03:09.423 --> 00:03:11.004
"What's going on?"

64
00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:13.586
"Huh?" Terrell said.

65
00:03:13.606 --> 00:03:15.128
"What happened?"

66
00:03:15.808 --> 00:03:18.170
He was standing in front of Metro City Elementary School.

67
00:03:18.751 --> 00:03:20.352
Papers and books lay on the blacktop.

68
00:03:20.892 --> 00:03:22.073
The doors were wide open.

69
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:24.455
Terrell ran inside.

70
00:03:26.657 --> 00:03:29.680
At the far end of the hallway, he saw Roxy dart into a restroom.

71
00:03:31.029 --> 00:03:32.413
Terrell hurried down the hallway.

72
00:03:33.135 --> 00:03:37.107
A second later the restroom door banged open, and Rocket Girl burst out!
